# L §7.1: "the step of a round is 1 with a unit, minor(CUR) (a currency's declared minor unit, C-3), or a row" in a
# def (LOAD-LITERAL otherwise).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

unit CHF: currency minor 0.01
input p: money CHF

def r: money CHF at reader
  rule base = round(p, 0.05 CHF, half-up)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LITERAL ...
